        {
          "text": "Lino Davida wakasika ku-Nobi kuli-Ahimeleki mupaizi. Nkabela Ahimeleki wakakankama naakabona Davida, wakati, Ino nkaambonzi noza olike, taakwe angomuli awe? ",
