                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Davida wakavwiila mupaizi kuti, Ncobeni twakacelezegwa kuya kubanakazi mazuba otatwe, alimwi ciindi eco ncindakanyampuka, inkomo zyabalombe zyakasalala, nikuba kuti lweendo lwesu ndwabantu buyo, lino sunu ncobeni inkomo zyabo zilainda kusalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
