            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino kakuli umwi muntu wabalanda ba-Saulo wakaliwo mubuzuba obo, wakalikasidwe kubusyu bwa-Jehova, izina lyakwe kali Doegi mu-Edomi, kali singuzu akati kabasilutwe ba-Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Davida wakaambila Ahimeleki kuti, Sa taakwe isumo nunka ipanga okuno kulinduwe? Nkaambo nsiletede ipanga lyangu azintu zyangu, nkaambo makani aamwami akandibinzya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
